# Lumina build-time config (Vite). Non-secret values only.
#
# Free-mode proxy: the Cloudflare Worker that fronts OpenRouter's free models.
# This URL is PUBLIC and safe to commit — the OpenRouter API key lives server-side
# inside the Worker (set via `wrangler secret put`), never here and never in the
# client bundle. The Worker enforces the free-model allowlist, failover, CORS,
# and rate limiting.
VITE_FREE_PROXY_URL=https://lumina-openrouter-free.luminous-reader.workers.dev
